  trashHints:
  - 'some people are so careless when walking through the village...They just leave
    this material lying around. But maybe you can use it as well?  '
  - 'some people drive by in their boats sometimes... I think I saw them throw this
    material overboard. What a shame. But I think this material could be a good addition
    to the mix! '
  - "I saw some seagulls trying to snack on something before \u2013 Thankfully they
    spit it out \u2013 I think they mistook it for crabs. Well, it would not hurt
    to tidy up the place, and maybe you can use the material as well?  "
  - 'You know the kind of stuff people often use for packaging? I think I saw some
    lying around on the beach yesterday. It might be worth grabbing as well. '
  materialName: Plastic
